  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed extension by reason of size, siting and design would appear bulky and incongruous, and would represent an overly dominant, incongruous and visually intrusive addition, out of keeping and character with, and detrimental to, the appearance and character of the property and surrounding area.  The proposal would be contrary to London Plan (2021) policy D4, Core Strategy (2010) Policy CP30, Development Management Document (2014) Policies DMD11 and DMD37 and National Planning Policy Framework (2024).",
    "The proposed rear extension by reason of its siting, depth and height would have an overbearing effect upon the adjoining properties at number 5 and 9 Briar Close, through loss of light and outlook detrimental to the amenities of the adjoining neighbouring occupiers.  The proposal would be contrary to Core Strategy (2010) CP30 and Development Management Document (2014) Policies DMD8, DMD11 and DMD37."
